{"id":"ga8r9bcibkw45ohd170301vwb","title":"EPFL团队在Nature绘制小鼠脑脂质图谱，发现539个化学区域","originalTitle":"Scientists uncover a hidden map of the brain with 539 distinct regions","summary":"EPFL团队绘制了小鼠脑脂质图谱，发现539个具有独特脂质组合的化学区域。研究使用质谱成像分析11只小鼠的109个脑切片和172种脂质，生成约700万次测量，并通过机器学习重建三维图谱。妊娠小鼠多个脑区的脂质组成发生明显变化，图谱已免费在线开放，可用于研究脑发育、衰老及阿尔茨海默病和抑郁症相关变化。","reason":"研究将脂质分布与脑区结构联系起来，并展示妊娠期小鼠脑脂质的广泛变化，为研究脑衰老和疾病提供了新的空间参照。","source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 健康医学"},"links":{"original":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/10/261012185011.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-13T05:00:55.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-13T12:33:29.354Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-13T12:33:29.354Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":85,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"439107f3-7f4b-4bc5-823e-efbf503cdb85","title":"EPFL绘制小鼠脑脂质图谱"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"439107f3-7f4b-4bc5-823e-efbf503cdb85","title":"EPFL绘制小鼠脑脂质图谱"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fRs8Da5jGz1w","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}